<Layout title="Privacy Policy — JoyLabs Software Studio" description="How JoyLabs handles information when you use this website.">
  <main class="legal shell"><span class="eyebrow">Website information</span><h1 class="section-title">Privacy Policy</h1><p class="updated">Last updated: 23 September 2026</p><p>This website is a service catalog for JoyLabs Software Studio. It does not store contact form submissions on a JoyLabs server. When WhatsApp is configured, submitting the project form opens a pre-filled message in WhatsApp; you review and send it yourself. WhatsApp then handles that conversation under its own privacy terms.</p><h2>Information you choose to share</h2><p>If you contact JoyLabs by email or WhatsApp, JoyLabs receives the details you include so we can respond and discuss your project. Please avoid sending sensitive personal or payment information in an initial inquiry.</p><h2>Payments</h2><p>This site does not collect payment details or host checkout. After a project scope and price are agreed, JoyLabs may send a Midtrans Payment Link. Payment information is handled through the Midtrans-hosted payment page.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For privacy questions, contact JoyLabs using the contact details displayed on this website once configured.</p><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/#contact">Back to contact</a></main>
</Layout>
<style>.legal{padding:90px 0 110px;max-width:820px}.legal h2{margin-top:34px;font-size:1.12rem}.legal p{color:#aab8b1;line-height:1.8;font-size:.9rem}.legal .updated{font-size:.74rem;color:#85938c;margin-bottom:30px}</style>
